At a Distance Spring Is Green","description":"","card_type":"normalPoster","type":"SERIES","url":"","style":{"image":"https://cdn7.albox.co/storage/CLOUD00/shows/f03a388b-0bf3-409c-b619-dd5b77984fea.jpg"},"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0},{"items":[],"id":21904,"title":"XX","description":"","card_type":"normalPoster","type":"SERIES","url":"","style":{"image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/CLOUD00/shows/bb76c543-6c12-4d5d-9577-9f91bf80ce3b.jpg"},"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0},{"items":[],"id":29593,"title":"King the Land","description":"","card_type":"normalPoster","type":"SERIES","url":"","style":{"image":"https://cloud01.albox.co/shows/1be487e2-052f-4753-ae09-b2e9bd99d01a.jpg"},"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Related","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":17662,"title":"","description":"1","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Adventure","Drama","Romance","Comedy","Mystery","Life","Friendship"],"id":17662,"type":"SERIES","title":"The Package..","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk43/seasons/261892b9-f835-41d3-a3e3-091c0563c1fe.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk53/seasons/4b32aa60-809b-48e4-ad03-37ddb929b80e.webp","likes":15,"dislikes":0,"views":1986,"release_date":"1507852800000","season_number":1,"description":"Yoon So So leaves on a trip to Europe with her boyfriend she met in college despite her parents’ disapproval, dreaming of a romantic journey. A few years later, her boyfriend heartlessly comes back to Korea alone, leaving So So behind. So So couldn't help but start working as a tour guide in France to make a living. She leads a group of people traveling with the “Luxurious Premium Tour Package: 1 Week in France”. So So always does her best so that those traveling to a faraway place can make the best memories of their lives. However, this team isn’t easy to break the ice. A man that left without his girlfriend, a couple that has been dating for 10 years, an old couple that growls at each other during the entire trip, and father and daughter that seem like strangers… The members couldn't be more troublesome, especially, San Ma Roo, a guy who travels alone in this group. He fought with his girlfriend 3 days before the trip and had to leave her behind and come by himself. He is a nuisance from day one. Yet during the trip, So So learns that Ma Roo is her fated lover. She does not want to believe that as she does not believe in Fate. Yet, when they are left alone on an island, they start to share each other's pain from previous relationships, and as such, they begin developing feelings mutually. What will So So's decision after meeting Ma Roo? Will she go back to Korea to join him and her family or consider this relationship merely a whim?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.2}],"value":8.2,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":5782,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}